_kwDOA0JFE85NDWcu","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-10-26T22:18:16Z","updated_at":"2022-10-26T22:18:16Z","body":"So there actually is already an `IJG` license on the license list, at https://spdx.org/licenses/IJG.html.\r\n\r\nIt contains a bunch of extraneous beginning and end matter, but the part in the middle appears to be identical to the one submitted here, other than containing this additional sentence after the 3 clauses:\r\n\r\n> These conditions apply to any software derived from or based on the IJG code, not just to the unmodified library. If you use our work, you ought to acknowledge us.\r\n\r\nI think even if the beginning and end matter were considered extraneous, that sentence is probably enough to say that this submission is different from the existing `IJG` license.\r\n\r\n@richardfontana I don't suppose you (or the Fedora community) might have suggestions for a contact at Independent JPEG Group, who might be willing to weigh in on naming for this license / identifier?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1292724014/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1315945137","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1606#issuecomment-1315945137","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1606","id":1315945137,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85Ob7qx","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-11-15T22:24:14Z","updated_at":"2022-11-15T22:24:14Z","body":"good catch, @swinslow - looking more closely https://spdx.org/licenses/IJG.html - the beginning part is already marked as optional.\r\n\r\nWe didn't mark everything after \"We specifically permit and encourage the use of ...\" as optional, but that information is really about other parts of the distribution that is under different licenses... so I'm wondering if that shouldn't be part of the IJG license anyway? ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"re