an't find it on this page: https://www.ijg.org/files/\r\n\r\nPerhaps this one can be called IJG-1991 or IJG-Original or something like that, assuming SPDX IJG can't accommodate it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1315961115/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1330998530","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1606#issuecomment-1330998530","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1606","id":1330998530,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85PVW0C","user":{"login":"bsdimp","id":4139006,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzkwMDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4139006?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp","html_url":"https://github.com/bsdimp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-11-29T17:12:29Z","updated_at":"2022-11-29T17:12:29Z","body":"+1 for inclusion. Agnostic on means (markup on existing IJG license, or as a new one with appropriate name).\r\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1330998530/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1336267495","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1606#issuecomment-1336267495","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1606","id":1336267495,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85PpdLn","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-12-03T22:10:52Z","updated_at":"2022-12-03T22:10:52Z","body":"+1 to add.\r\n\r\nI do think it warrants having a separate identifier from `IJG`, given the additional language noted above. I think that's substantively different enough that adding markup for `IJG` wouldn't be appropriate (given SPDX's low threshold for this).\r\n\r\nI'm good with @richardfontana's proposal of `IJG-1991`. I'd probably not go with `IJG-Original` on the off chance that it turns out there's a more-original version that comes out of the woodwork  :) ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1336267495/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1338757673","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1606#issuecomment-1338757673","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1606","id":1338757673,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85Py9Ip","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-12-06T05:00:37Z","updated_at":"2022-12-06T05:00:37Z","body":"+1 to add but given 1991 is in the copyright notice of the IJG on the SPDX License List, maybe we should do a word, like `IJG-acknowledge` ?\r\n\r\nAlso, the full name needs to be different from the other one already on the list, but I suppose we could mirror the id with something like, \"Independent JPEG Group License - acknowledge\" ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"